# Files clang-format must not touch. `git clang-format` reads this too, so the
# changed-lines gate in .ci/ci-lint-cpp.sh skips them.
#
# The SDL_GPU shader headers are generated by tools/shaders/build.sh (a byte
# array, 16 per line, tab-led). Hand-formatting them would be overwritten by the
# next build, and clang-format repacks the array, so a regenerated header would
# otherwise fail the gate on lines no one wrote.
src/sgp/shaders/*.h
